      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I contacted Adam from Empire Energy to give me a quote on solar installation after the company installed a substantial system on my son's newly renovated house in Elderslie.Adam contacted me in a timely manner, discussed my needs and recommended a 7.7kw Solar Edge solution based on my existing energy usage. I had just installed a pool with a heat pump and noticed my energy consumption was climbing to uncomfortable levels. The quote was thorough and he followed up with a meeting to make sure I understood all the details, costs and savings associated with the installations. He was able to answer any question I asked and I was impressed with his in depth knowledge and no pressure pitch. He knew he had a great product and let it speak for itself.I had done fairly rigorous research into solar energy benefits and was convinced that Empire Energy had the balance between quality components and outlay $$ just right so I proceeded with the purchase.Wayne and his team turned up well within the time frame discussed and completed a quality installation with showed great attention to detail. They were obviously skilled, knowledgeable and went well beyond requirements to maintain a clean worksite and showed care to and respect for my property.Needless to say I am completely happy with the choice of components, the ease of the process from quote to completion and the excellent follow up provided.You can get cheaper systems but I believe that Empire Energy provided outstanding value for what I purchased. With monitoring software I can easily keep track of input and output therefore modifying my energy usage to take advantage of the system.Empire Energy is a family based company and does not employ specialist sales staff, this was an important fact for me as I had been turned off in the past by high pressure salesmen and their obvious inability to answer questions to my satisfaction posed about quality and reliability of their products..I feel very confident that Wayne and his team will be available in the long term to provide any backup should it be required.Obviously I am extremely satisfied with the whole service provided by this company hence this very strong recommendation.",
